OL,3,GNEWSAKids food scheme set to grow after
OL,4,A'crazy' support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme which provides food for
OL,7,Fchildren in low income families in East
OL,8,FSussex is set to reach more households
OL,9,Fafter it was backed by #30,000 in
OL,10,Fdonations received from across the
OL,11,Fworld.
OL,13,FBarry Ashley, who owns the The Grumpy
OL,14,FCook cafe in Hastings, began offering
OL,15,Ffood to schoolchildren over the summer
OL,16,Fholidays, paid for by donations.
OL,18,FAshley now says that, because of the
OL,19,Fscheme's success, he wants to extend it
OL,20,Fto weekends outside of the school
OL,21,Fholidays, and expand to other parts of
OL,22,FEast Sussex.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
